//!     `0x80268620..0x802696B0`, the min-cost node scan at `0x80269E10`, the
//!     list drain at `0x8026A1B0` and the tail forwarder at `0x8026F630`.
//!     Twenty-nine bodies. See the wave-89 section at the end. `// inferred:`
//!     the records are the NW4R sound-manager singleton at `0x803FC91C`, its
//!     0x48-byte channel descriptors and the handle-node lists the wave-41/73
//!     sections documented; the exports prove only the offsets, the constants
//!     and the callee addresses.
//! 12. **`0x802B0000`-band record adders, polygon payload and effect state** -
//!     the four-byte record copy and the twelve `+` helpers at
//!     `0x802B2A20..0x802B2B40`, the polygon payload decoder at `0x802B4C60`,
