/// Attaches a U8 image and a member name to a table entry.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_802b6680` at `0x802B6680` (124 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/802b6680_FUN_802b6680.c`
