/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/802be210_FUN_802be210.c`
/// - observed: `param_1[1] = param_2; iVar1 = FUN_802b9250(param_2 << 2);
///   param_1[2] = iVar1; (**(code **)(*param_1 + 0x14))(param_1,0);`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: object with the vtable at `+0x00`.
/// - `count`: number of words.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Stores the count, allocates `count * 4` bytes and calls vtable slot
/// `+0x14(this, 0)`.
