/// - observed: `*param_1 = &DAT_8034fb68; param_1[0xd..0x10] = uVar1;
///   param_1[0x11..0x13] = uVar2; FUN_800046b4(param_1 + 0x14,0,1);
///   FUN_801c04d0(param_1 + 1); return param_1;`
/// - `// inferred:` the two `r2` words are default colour/coordinate words and
///   the `0x800046B4` call clears one byte of the `+0x50` tail.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: descriptor to initialise (at least `0x51` bytes).
///
/// # Returns
