//     two 0x20-byte block copies that expand an interleaved zero pattern.
//   * `0x80264680..0x802656F0` - the `+0x30` mode selector, the singleton list
//     initialisers, the descriptor destructor/insert/remove trio and the
//     `RBKN` block decoder.
//   * `0x80265DB0..0x80266D80` - the two fixed field initialisers and the
//     `+0x88` mode test plus its two counters.
//   * `0x802676C0..0x8026A1B0` - the `+0x10` virtual forwarder, the state
//     setters behind `0x802686A0`/`0x80268710`, the two 0xA0/0xAC-byte record
//     initialisers, the min-cost node scan and the list drain.
//   * `0x8026F630` - the one-argument tail forwarder into `0x8026D9B0`.
//
// `// inferred:` the records are the NW4R sound-manager singleton at
// `0x803FC91C`, its 0x48-byte channel descriptors and the handle-node lists the
