// Wave 92 - `0x80260000`-band resident manager, member records and voice
// parameter stores (0x80260950..0x8026DF50)
//
// The exports in this band all operate on the NW4R sound manager at
// `0x803FC810` (documented in the wave-49 section), its "member" records and
// the stream records behind the `0x80267E30` constructor. Shared fields:
//
// - manager list head `+0x18`, current node `+0x1C`, member-list heads at
//   `+0xB4` and links at `+0xB8` for slot 0..2 (`+0xB4 + slot * 0xC`);
// - member record: child handle at `+0x00`, changed-flag word at `+0x04`,
//   cursor halfwords at `+0x08`/`+0x92`/`+0x94`, mode word at `+0x14`;
// - stream record: `+0x0C` open byte, `+0x10` mode word, `+0x1C` block,
//   `+0x35..+0x37` state bytes, `+0xD0` stream handle.
//
// `// inferred:` the roles come from the repeated guard/memcpy/publish
// sequences in the exports; the offsets, masks and callee addresses are
// literal.
