/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Clears and initialises the two global blocks, binds three channel pairs,
/// installs the frame callback `0x80261190`, writes six SDA link words, and
/// masks/restores interrupts.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be writable through `+0x18`; the global blocks and the frame
