/// - `values`: 24 halfwords in the order the child expects at `+0x3C`.
/// - `publish`: 0 to raise the owner flags, non-zero to raise the child flags.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes 48 bytes at `child + 0x3C`, the packed channel word at `child + 0x34`
/// and the `0x12` bits, under interrupt masking.
///
/// # Safety
/// `values` must be readable for 48 bytes and a non-null child writable at
/// `+0x34..+0x6B`.
