///   param_1[1] = (float)((double)CONCAT44(0x43300000,(uint)*(ushort *)
///   (iVar3 + 10)) - dVar4); *param_1 = ...uVar2...; } else { fVar1 =
///   *(float *)(r2 - 0x3fc0); *param_1 = fVar1; param_1[1] = fVar1; }`
/// - the `CONCAT44(0x43300000, x) - 2^52` pair is the compiler's unsigned
///   `u16 -> f32` conversion, so it is written as a plain `as f32` cast.
///
