/// Dispatches the queue until its budget is met.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80269d00` at `0x80269d00` (188 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80269d00_FUN_80269d00.c`
