///   picks the minimum-scored node of the `+0x04` list and runs its virtual
///   `+0x10` slot.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `list`: queue header.
/// - `budget`: new budget word.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Runs one virtual slot per iteration.
///
/// # Safety
/// The queue must contain at least one node whenever the budget is below the
/// target; the export has no null guard.
