/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: voice-holder record.
/// - `value`: base tick/note value.
/// - `index`: one-based tick index.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes the handle's `+0x9E`/`+0xA0` window and raises bit `0x2000`.
///
/// # Safety
/// The handle must be writable through `+0xA1`.
///
