/// Rewrites both voice note windows and clears the third.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_802622a0` at `0x802622A0` (500 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/802622a0_FUN_802622a0.c`
