/// Rebuilds the payload list of one stream record.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8026a420` at `0x8026A420` (548 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8026a420_FUN_8026a420.c`
/// - observed: `if (count == 0) { while (this[1] != 0) { drain the inner list
