/// - `y`: vertical ordinate (`r5`, converted through the 2^52 idiom).
/// - `unused4`: sixth register; the export never reads it.
/// - `alpha`: added to `beta` for the FIFO halfword (`param_5`).
/// - `unused6`: eighth register; the export never reads it.
/// - `beta`: the second added byte (`param_7`).
