/// Builds the EGG controller manager and fills its four controller slots.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_802bd4a0` at `0x802BD4A0` (800 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/802bd4a0_FUN_802bd4a0.c`
