///   `0x80350020`/`0x80350004`/`0x8034FFE8` vtables and three zeroed pairs;
///   when `*(r13 - 0x4800) == 0` it allocates the debug-named
///   `"EGG::CoreControllerMgr"` object through `0x802B9430`, wraps it with
///   `0x802B8A70`, stores it at `r13 - 0x47FC` and registers `0x802BD420`;
///   then it clears `this + 0x20`, runs the two vtable slots, waits for a
///   retrace, registers four factories, and fills the four `+0x1C` slots either
