// Every body here reads or writes the same object: a halfword flag word at
// `+0x68`, a mode byte at `+0x3D`, two colour bytes at `+0x3E`/`+0x3F`, a
// three-float vector at `+0x94`, a colour/alpha triple at `+0x7C`, the
// `+0x4C`/`+0x58` extras and the `+0x78` mode word. `// inferred:` the object
// is the screen-effect/controller record documented by the earlier waves at
// `0x802BB000`; the exports prove only the offsets and the callees.

