///   `0x802C4700`; every other value calls [`fn_802c3d80`]. Both receive
///   `(this, mode)`.
/// - observed: `mode == 1` runs `0x802D2310(0, this)` and then
///   `0x802D21F0(3, this)`; `mode == 2` releases `*(this+0x88)` through
///   `0x802D3370` and clears the field.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: live object of the base `0x80350230` family.
/// - `mode`: `0` does the runtime teardown arm, `1` the unregister pair, `2`
///   the pane release.
///
