/// Mode-driven update/rebuild pass of the derived `0x803502A8` render object.
///
/// `// inferred:` the method is the derived class's animation/render state
/// machine. Mode 0 snapshots the shared render-state word into the object and
/// clears the viewport gate; mode 1 creates the `+0x1C` child pane (kind 1 or
/// 6) and optionally the `+0x20` second pane; mode 2 tears the whole set down
