/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: no export and no `functions.tsv` row for `0x802C5760`.
/// - Evidence: `work/dol/main.elf`, disassembly `0x802C5760..0x802C5F7F`;
///   `bclr 20,0` at `0x802C5F80`.
/// - extent: 2084 bytes (`0x824`); `0x802C5F84..0x802C5F8F` is three zero
///   words of padding before [`fn_802c5f90`].
/// - vtable evidence: the word at `0x803502EC` (file offset `0x34C84C`), the
///   `+0x20` slot of the `0x803502C4` sub-vtable, mirroring
///   [`fn_802c5f90`]'s primary entry.
