/// Applies a `0x28`-byte transform/colour record to the `0x803502F8` object.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: no export and no `functions.tsv` row for `0x802C6170`.
/// - Evidence: `work/dol/main.elf`, disassembly `0x802C6170..0x802C61CF`;
///   `bclr 20,0` at `0x802C61CC`.
/// - extent: 96 bytes (`0x60`); the next body starts at `0x802C61D0`.
/// - vtable evidence: the word at `0x80350300` (file offset `0x34C860`), the
///   first slot behind the `0x803502F8` header.
/// - observed: `lbz r0,0x8(r4)` / `cmpi` / `bclr 4,2` returns while the
///   record's guard byte is non-zero, exactly like [`fn_802c50b0`].
/// - observed: four floats `+0x10..+0x1C` land at object `+0x08..+0x14`;
///   four bytes `+0x20..+0x23` at object `+0x04..+0x07`; the zero-extended
///   byte `+0x24` at object `+0x18`; the byte `+0x25` at object `+0x1C`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: live object of the `0x803502F8` family.
/// - `record`: readable `0x28`-byte record.
