// Wave 241, lane F - the callers of the `0x803502F8` record plus the
// `0x80350370` layout-table codecs.
//
// Wave 240 closed `0x803502F8..0x80350310` (the five slots behind that header).
// This lane continues the same table band in word order, taking the next ten
// uncovered slots:
//
//   `0x802C66F0`  0x80350320  (`0x80350318` slot 0)
//   `0x802C6840`  0x80350324  (slot 1)
