/// Loads one transfer block into the row-table object, dispatching on its mode.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: no export and no `functions.tsv` row for `0x802C8D10`.
/// - Evidence: `work/dol/main.elf`, disassembly `0x802C8D10..0x802C9307`;
///   `bclr 20,0` at `0x802C9304`.
/// - extent: 1528 bytes (`0x5F8`); `0x802C9308..0x802C930F` is padding before
///   [`fn_802c9310`].
/// - vtable evidence: the word at `0x80350378` (file offset `0x34C8D8`), slot 0
///   of the `0x80350370` row-table class of [`fn_802c8450`].
/// - observed: `lbz r0,0x8(r4)` selects `0 = 0x802C8D4C`, `1 = 0x802C8E08`,
///   `2 = 0x802C9088`; every other value falls straight through to the
///   epilogue.
/// - observed, mode 0: loads `min(*(u16 *)(record + 0x10), *(byte *)(this +
///   0x04))` records from `record + 0x30` (stride `0x50`) into `this + 0x08`
///   (stride `0xA4`) through the record's `+0x08` virtual, copies
///   `record + 0x14..0x17` to row 0, `record + 0x18..0x1B` to row 1, and the
///   default tint `00 00 00 FF` (`r2 - 0x3E40`) to `this + 0x18..0x1B`.
