/// - observed: forwards preset `7`, the mode-10 arm of the [`fn_802cea40`]
///   `match`, and the highest mode the dispatcher accepts (`*mode <= 10`).
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `_mode`: the dispatcher's register, unused - the arm overwrites `r3`.
///
/// # Safety
/// The `0x802C3020` preset table must be readable and the GX pipeline ready.
///
