///   `fcmpo cr0,f1,f0` / `bc 4,0` then `addi r3,r1,0xC` / `mr r4,r3` /
///   `li r5,1` / `bl 0x802CEAF0`;
///   `bl 0x802CE940`; `li r3,1` / `bl 0x801C4A20`;
///   `bl 0x801C47D0(0,1,4,30,0,125)`; `bl 0x802CED80(this, sp+0x10)`;
///   `bl 0x801C9A80(sp+0x10,30,1)`; `bl 0x802CE9B0`;
///   `bl 0x801C88F0(1)`; `bl 0x801C8130(0)`; `bl 0x801C8600(0,0,0)`;
///   `bl 0x801C8640(0,0,1,2,3)`; `bl 0x801C8560(0,12)`;
///   `bl 0x801C85B0(0,28)`; `bl 0x801C8500(0,&colour)`;
///   `bl 0x801C8790(0,0,+0x08,255)`; `bl 0x801C82F0(0,15,8,14,15)`;
///   `bl 0x801C8370(0,0,0,+0x34,1,0)`; the `+0x38` arms at `0x802D09D8`;
///   `bl 0x801C83D0(0,0,0,+0x34,1,0)`; `bl 0x802CE9C0(this)`.
/// - extent: 520 bytes; the next body `0x802D0AA0` starts immediately.
/// - table evidence: the `+0x10` slot of [`VTABLE_803504C0_F246`], word
///   `0x803504D0`, between the scaler `0x802CE7A0` (`+0x0C`) and the shared
///   binder `0x802CE8F0` (`+0x14`).
/// - observed: the comparison is `f1 < 1.0` -> skip, so the scale runs for
///   `+0x30 >= 1.0` and also for a NaN multiplier (unordered clears `LT`).
/// - observed: `r4` of the `+0x14` dispatch is not loaded by this body, so the
///   helper receives `0`; [`fn_802ce8f0`] ignores it.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: record using [`VTABLE_803504C0_F246`]; `+0x2C` is the packed colour
///   word, `+0x30` its scale, `+0x34` the TEV op scale and `+0x38` the mode.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One virtual pane bind, one optional colour scale, one matrix upload and one
/// TEV stage block, ending in [`fn_802ce9c0`]`(this)`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be a live record whose `+0x28` table has a callable `+0x14`
/// slot; the GX pipeline must be ready for every callee.
///
/// # Confidence
