/// `this`-adjusting thunk: `this - 8` -> [`fn_80196f40`].
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: no export and no `functions.tsv` row for `0x801971A0`.
/// - Evidence: `work/dol/main.elf`, disassembly `0x801971A0..0x801971A7`:
///   `addi r3,r3,-8`; `b 0x80196F40`.
/// - extent: two instructions = 8 bytes; the two `0x00000000` words at
///   `0x801971A8`/`0x801971AC` are alignment padding and the next thunk
///   `0x801971B0` follows.
