///   adjustment matches the `+0x08` install offset of
///   [`crate::runtime::cpp::fn_802d46e0`].
/// - the branch is a `b`, not a `bl`, so the callee's `bclr 20,0` returns to
///   the caller that dispatched this slot and `r3` is the callee's result.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: pointer to the sub-object at `+0x08` of the archive object (`r3`);
///   eight is subtracted before the branch.
/// - `index`: list index (`r4`), forwarded unchanged.
