///   `lwz r3,0xC(r29)`; `cmpi cr0,0,r3,0`; `bc 12,2,0x802D4ED4`;
///   `bl 0x802B9730`; `li r0,0`; `stw r0,0x0(r29)`; `li r3,1`;
///   `stw r0,0x4(r29)`; `lwz r31,0x1C(r1)`; `lwz r30,0x18(r1)`;
///   `lwz r29,0x14(r1)`; `lwz r0,0x24(r1)`; `mtlr r0`; `addi r1,r1,0x20`;
///   `bclr 20,0`.
/// - extent: 72 bytes, `0x802D4EB8..0x802D4F00`; the tabled `0x802D4F00`
///   constructor starts immediately.
/// - table evidence: word `0x8035066C`, entry 0 of the nine-word table at
///   `0x8035066C`, directly behind entry 8 of the first table (`0x80350668`).
/// - `// inferred:` the dispatch head `0x802D4DDC..0x802D4DFB` is folded in as
///   the `kind` test because it is not itself a table word; the eight arms it
///   selects all reduce to [`release_chain_record`].
/// - observed: `r0` is zeroed once and stored to both `+0x00` and `+0x04`; the
///   resource word read from `+0x0C` is the `r3` argument of `0x802B9730`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: effect slot, the live `r29` (`+0x00` head, `+0x04` tail,
///   `+0x0C` resource).
/// - `record`: current chain record, the live `r30`; non-null.
///
/// # Returns
/// `1`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `record` must be a live record of `this`'s chain; every following record
/// must be live and its object vtable must have a valid `+0x20` slot; a
/// non-zero `this + 0x0C` must be a live heap object.
