// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// `0x802D8230` - reciprocal pair plus two virtual stores
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Builds a two-float value, then publishes it through two virtual slots.
///
/// The pair starts at `1.0, 1.0`. When `pair` is non-null its two words are
/// copied verbatim; otherwise the first two floats of `direction` are
/// converted to reciprocals with the shipped epsilon guard: a component whose
/// absolute value is below `FLT_EPSILON` becomes `0.0`, every other component
/// becomes `1.0 / component` (keeping its sign).
