///   `0x80288E08`: `stwu r1,-0xE0`; the `+0x0C` state pair test; the `+0x24`
///   mask pair (`0x10000`/`0x8000`); three `stfs` of `0.0`; `stb 1,+0x120`;
///   `bl 0x80289070`; the `*(*(this+0xBC)+0x20)+0xC02C` load and
///   `bl 0x801C0540`; twelve-word copy; three `bl 0x802966F0` calls with the
///   diagonal stores; the `+0x24 & 0x8000` branch calling `0x802963B0` with
///   `pi/2` and `0x801C0540`; the in-place `0x801C07A0`; the second
///   `0x801C0540`; `0x80296640`, `0x802965B0`, `0x80295A90`, `0x802891C0`.
