///   branch to `0x801D5560`.
/// - Evidence: `work/dol/main.elf`.
/// - observed: `mr r6,r3`; `mr r3,r4`; `lwz r4,16(r6)`; `b 0x801D5560` - the
///   allocator arrives in `r4`, the heap head in `r3`, the alignment in `r5`.
