/// - `other`: object whose slot `+0x18` runs; its receiver is returned.
///
/// # Returns
/// The callee's `r3`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `other` must start with a vtable whose `+0x18` slot accepts `(other, this, 0)`.
///
/// # Confidence
