/// Walks the `+0x08` child ring and calls each child's `+0x20` slot.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row for `0x802B4960`.
/// - Extent: `0x802B4960..0x802B49D8` (120 bytes, 30 words), ending at the
